| Add hpp | `npm i hpp` – `app.use(hpp());` | Parameter pollution mitigation |
| Add dotenv | `npm i dotenv` – `require('dotenv').config();` | Environment variables |
| Add express‑json | `app.use(express.json({ limit: '100kb' }));` | Body parser |
| Add error handler file | Create `errors/errorHandler.js` – export function – `app.use(errorHandler);` | Central error handling |
| Add input validation library | `npm i express-validator` – see example above | Input validation |

