| Feature | What it protects | How it works |
|---------|-----------------|--------------|
| **helmet** | Click‑jacking, MIME sniffing, XSS | Sets `X-Frame-Options`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `X-XSS-Protection`, etc. |
