| **express‑validator** | Input tampering (e.g., SQL/NoSQL inject) | Enforces type + range limits. |
| **Central error handler** | Information leakage | Prevents stack traces from going to clients. |
| **dotenv / ENV vars** | Hard‑coded secrets / port | Keeps configuration separate from code. |
| **`use strict`** | Unexpected global leaks | Forces strict mode semantics. |

