## 2. Error Handling

| Problem | Impact | Fix / Recommendation |
|---------|--------|----------------------|
| No global error handler | Unhandled rejections / exceptions crash the server. | Add an Express error‑handling middleware (`app.use((err, req, res, next) => { … })`). Ensure `process.on('unhandledRejection', …)` / `process.on('uncaughtException', …)` log the error and shut down gracefully. |
