## Optional Further Hardening

| Feature | Why | How to add |
|---------|-----|------------|
| Input validation | Prevent injection & improper data formats | Use `express-validator` or `joi` to sanitise query & body params |
| CSRF protection | For any `POST`/`PUT` endpoints | `csurf` middleware + same‑site cookies |
| HTTPS / HSTS | Force secure connections | In production proxy with Nginx/Traefik; add `app.enable('trust proxy')` and set `helmet.hsts()` |
| Content‑Security‑Policy | Stops XSS from inline scripts | `helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({ directives: { ... } })` |
| Logging | Structured logs (Pino / winston) | Replace `console.log` with a logger that emits JSON, redact PII |

